    "{0} cihaz g\u00fcncellendi.": "{0} dispositivo/i aggiornato/i.", // EN: {0} device(s) updated.
    "tetiklendi; tan\u0131ml\u0131 eylem yok (Senaryo Ayarlar\u0131'ndan bir senaryo se\u00e7ebilirsin).": "innescato;nessuna azione definita (scegli uno scenario dalle Impostazioni scenario).", // EN: triggered; no action defined (pick a scenario from Scenario Settings).
    "{0} cihaz\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fc kesildi.": "interruzione di corrente su {0} dispositivo/i.", // EN: power cut to {0} device(s).
    "Gece stratejisi tetiklendi; se\u00e7ili enerji cihaz\u0131 yok.": "Attivata la strategia notturna;nessun dispositivo energetico selezionato.", // EN: Night strategy triggered; no selected energy devices.
    "Enerji stratejisi \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131": "La strategia energetica \u00e8 andata avanti", // EN: Energy strategy ran
    "G\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131 tetikleyicisi: ev konumu se\u00e7ilmedi.": "Attivazione del tramonto: nessuna posizione di casa impostata.", // EN: Sunset trigger: no home location set.
    "Tetikleme saati ka\u00e7\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 (uygulama kapal\u0131yd\u0131).": "Tempo di attivazione mancato (l'app \u00e8 stata chiusa).", // EN: Trigger time missed (the app was closed).
    "Kameralar": "Fotocamere", // EN: Cameras
    "Kamera Cihazlar\u0131m": "Le mie macchine fotografiche", // EN: My Cameras
    "Kamera ekleyince durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 buradan izlersin. Video ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 (RTSP) deste\u011fi yak\u0131nda.": "Aggiungi una telecamera per monitorarne lo stato e le impostazioni sulla privacy qui.Il supporto per lo streaming video (RTSP) sar\u00e0 presto disponibile.", // EN: Add a camera to monitor its status and privacy setting here. Video streaming (RTSP) support is coming soon.
    "Kamera Ekle": "Aggiungi fotocamera", // EN: Add Camera
    "Bu ekranda kamera cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n ger\u00e7ek durumu listelenir. Canl\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fc ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 i\u00e7in cihaz\u0131n\u0131n kendi uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullanabilirsin.": "Questa schermata elenca lo stato reale dei tuoi dispositivi fotocamera.Per i video in diretta, utilizza l'app della tua fotocamera.", // EN: This screen lists the real status of your camera devices. For live video, use your camera's own app.
    "G\u0130ZL\u0130L\u0130K MODU": "MODALIT\u00c0 PRIVACY", // EN: PRIVACY MODE
    "Yerle\u015fik k\u00f6pr\u00fc yok": "Nessun ponte integrato", // EN: No built-in bridge
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc i\u00e7ermez. Apple Ev (HomeKit) ile kullanmak istersen en pratik yol Home Assistant k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcd\u00fcr: cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'a ekler, HA'n\u0131n HomeKit entegrasyonunu a\u00e7ars\u0131n.": "NEXUS controlla i tuoi dispositivi direttamente dalla propria app;non include un bridge HomeKit.Per utilizzarli con Apple Home (HomeKit), il percorso pratico \u00e8 il bridge Home Assistant: aggiungi i tuoi dispositivi a Home Assistant, quindi abilita l'integrazione HomeKit di HA.", // EN: NEXUS controls your devices directly from its own app; it does not include a HomeKit bridge. To use them with Apple Home (HomeKit), the practical path is the Home Assistant bridge: add your devices to Home Assistant, then enable HA's HomeKit integration.
    "Home Assistant K\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fc A\u00e7": "Apri Home Assistant Bridge", // EN: Open Home Assistant Bridge
    "HomeKit ile Kullanma": "Utilizzo con HomeKit", // EN: Using with HomeKit
    "Masa\u00fcst\u00fc HomeKit K\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc": "Desktop HomeKit Bridge", // EN: Desktop HomeKit Bridge
    "masa\u00fcst\u00fc s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde": "sul desktop,", // EN: on desktop,
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir;": "NEXUS controlla i tuoi dispositivi direttamente dalla propria app;", // EN: NEXUS controls your devices directly from its own app;
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc Durdur": "Fermata del ponte", // EN: Stop Bridge
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor": "Ponte in corsa", // EN: Bridge running
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor": "Ponte non disponibile", // EN: Bridge unavailable
    "HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc bu kurulumda kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor (kit/bridge.cjs y\u00fcklenemedi) \u2014 Apple Ev i\u00e7in Home Assistant k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fc \u00f6neririz.": "Il bridge HomeKit non \u00e8 disponibile in questa installazione (impossibile caricare kit/bridge.cjs): per Apple Home consigliamo il bridge Home Assistant.", // EN: The HomeKit bridge isn't available in this install (kit/bridge.cjs could not be loaded) — for Apple Home we recommend the Home Assistant bridge.
    "\u00c7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor \u00b7 port {0} \u00b7 {1} cihaz": "In esecuzione \u00b7 porta {0} \u00b7 {1} dispositivi", // EN: Running · port {0} · {1} devices
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc, iOS cihaz\u0131nla ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da olmal\u0131. E\u015fle\u015fme kal\u0131c\u0131d\u0131r; NEXUS \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131p tepside bekledik\u00e7e ev uygulamas\u0131ndaki anahtarlar ger\u00e7ek cihaza gider.": "Il bridge deve trovarsi sulla stessa Wi-Fi del tuo dispositivo iOS.L'accoppiamento persiste;finch\u00e9 NEXUS rimane in esecuzione nel vassoio, gli interruttori nell'app Home vanno al dispositivo reale.", // EN: The bridge must be on the same Wi-Fi as your iOS device. Pairing persists; as long as NEXUS stays running in the tray, switches in the Home app go to the real device.
    "Hesab\u0131na ba\u011fl\u0131 kay\u0131tlar": "Collegato al tuo account", // EN: Linked to your account
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcler ve a\u00e7\u0131k kaynak": "Bridge e open source", // EN: Bridges and open source
    "Bu yaz\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131ran cihazlar a\u011fda otomatik bulunur.": "I dispositivi che eseguono questo software vengono rilevati automaticamente sulla rete.", // EN: Devices running this software are found automatically on the network.
    "HomeKit ve Apple Ev, Apple Inc. tescilli markalar\u0131d\u0131r. Bu ad\u0131mlar telefon/web s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc i\u00e7indir: cihaz kontrol\u00fc Home Assistant \u00fczerinden iletilir. Masa\u00fcst\u00fc s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde NEXUS kendi yerle\u015fik k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fc yay\u0131nlar (yukar\u0131daki panel).": "HomeKit e Apple Home sono marchi di Apple Inc. Questi passaggi si riferiscono alla versione telefono/web: il controllo del dispositivo viene inoltrato tramite Home Assistant.Sul desktop, NEXUS pubblica il proprio bridge integrato (il pannello sopra).", // EN: HomeKit and Apple Home are trademarks of Apple Inc. These steps are for the phone/web version: device control is relayed via Home Assistant. On desktop, NEXUS publishes its own built-in bridge (the panel above).
    "Payla\u015f\u0131lacak cihaz yok: yerel a\u011fda anahtar yetene\u011fi olan cihaz laz\u0131m": "Nessun dispositivo da condividere: \u00e8 richiesto un dispositivo con funzionalit\u00e0 switch sulla rete locale", // EN: No devices to share: a device with the switch capability on your local network is required
