    "Aboneli\u011finiz yok \u2014 t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u015fu an \u00fccretsiz. NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda.": "Non hai un abbonamento: ogni funzionalit\u00e0 \u00e8 gratuita al momento.NEXUS+ sar\u00e0 presto disponibile.", // EN: You don't have a subscription — every feature is free right now. NEXUS+ is coming soon.
