    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Spegni automaticamente le luci dopo che esci e accendile al tuo ritorno.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
