    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in bir sinema modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Film ba\u015flat, ses seviyesi, ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan gece e\u011flence k\u0131sayollar\u0131 olsun.": "Crea un'app in modalit\u00e0 cinema per TV e dispositivi multimediali.Include l'avvio del film, il volume, le luci ambientali e scorciatoie per l'intrattenimento serale senza distrazioni.", // EN: Create a cinema mode app for TVs and media devices. Include start movie, volume, ambient lights and distraction-free evening entertainment shortcuts.
