    "T\u00fcm evi oda bazl\u0131 kontrol eden bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 \u0131\u015f\u0131k paneli olu\u015ftur. Her oda i\u00e7in ac/kapat, parlakl\u0131k ve renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 kontrolleri olsun. Hemen kullan\u0131labilecek h\u0131zl\u0131 yuzdeler ve tumunu ac/tumunu kapat aksiyonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Crea un pannello di illuminazione intelligente che controlla l'intera casa, stanza per stanza.Include controlli di accensione/spegnimento, luminosit\u00e0 e temperatura colore per ogni stanza.Aggiungi percentuali rapide pronte all'uso e tutte le azioni on/all off.", // EN: Create a smart lighting panel that controls the whole home room by room. Include on/off, brightness and color temperature controls for each room. Add ready-to-use quick percentages and all on/all off actions.
