    "L\u00fctfen ge\u00e7erli bir e-posta gir.": "Inserisci un'e-mail valida.", // EN: Please enter a valid email.
    "Bu e-posta ile zaten bir hesap var. L\u00fctfen giri\u015f yap\u0131n.": "Esiste gi\u00e0 un account con questa email.Per favore accedi.", // EN: An account with this email already exists. Please sign in.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n s\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f ya da ge\u00e7ersiz. L\u00fctfen yeniden dene.": "Questo collegamento \u00e8 scaduto o non \u00e8 valido.Per favore riprova.", // EN: This link has expired or is invalid. Please try again.
    "Bulut hesab\u0131 bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kapal\u0131; yerel hesaplarda \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanamaz.": "L'account cloud \u00e8 disabilitato in questa build;le password degli account locali non possono essere reimpostate.", // EN: Cloud account is disabled in this build; local account passwords cannot be reset.
    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "Se questo indirizzo \u00e8 collegato a un account, \u00e8 stato inviato un collegamento di reimpostazione.Controlla la tua casella di posta (e la cartella spam).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denedin. Bir dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Troppi tentativi.Per favore riprova tra un minuto.", // EN: Too many attempts. Please try again in a minute.
